diff --git a/modules/newsletter/MODULE.md b/modules/newsletter/MODULE.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..b3befe8
--- /dev/null
+++ b/modules/newsletter/MODULE.md
@@ -0,0 +1,26 @@
+# newsletter
+
+Newsletter signups: validate a name and email, ignore repeat signups, and store
+subscribers privately.
+
+## Use it for
+
+- Handling the signup form: `subscribe({ name, email }, existing)` returns the
+  updated subscriber list, unchanged if that email is already subscribed.
+
+## Contract
+
+Shape: `Subscriber` from `@clubkit/schemas`. Emails are trimmed and lowercased.
+
+Storage: `migrations/0001_newsletter.sql` creates `public.newsletter_subscribers`.
+Subscribers are personal data: RLS is on with no policies, so signups go through
+a server route using the service role, and nobody can read the list with the anon key.
+
+## Rules for agents
+
+- Never expose the subscriber list to the browser or the anon key.
+- After changing this module, run `pnpm verify newsletter`.
+
+## Not yet included
+
+Unsubscribe links, double opt-in, and sending.
diff --git a/modules/newsletter/migrations/0001_newsletter.sql b/modules/newsletter/migrations/0001_newsletter.sql
